<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>My song shall be of Jesus</l><l>While pressing on my way</l><l>To reach the blissful kingdom</l><l>Of pure and perfect day:</l><l>And when my soul shall enter</l><l>That realm of splendor fair,</l><l>A song of praise to Jesus</l><l>I’ll sing forever there.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
